# Renderer (admin UI)

## Structure

- Pages: Login, Dashboard (ESP status/logs), Users (Users/Admins tabs), Activity, Profile.
- Auth via `AuthContext`; theme via `ThemeContext`; custom `TitleBar` for frameless window.
- Use `window.api` only — no direct Prisma/Node/net.

## UX rules

- Dashboard: live ESP connect indicator, hotspot host IPs, TCP traffic log.
- Users: editable keypad `userId`, Reset Bio for re-enroll; ADMIN vs USER fields differ.
- Activity: search + live `activity:onNew` stream for LOOKUP/SET/GET.

## Patterns

- Functional components + React Router.
- Subscribe to `esp:onStatus` / `esp:onLog` / `activity:onNew` in `useEffect`; return unsubscribe cleanups from preload helpers.
- Prefer Tailwind utility classes consistent with existing pages; keep military/door-access wording only on MCU LCD, not forced on admin UI.
